---
import { iterateLinearMixingMode } from '../../../data/part04/ch13TeachingModels.mjs';

const componentId = 'ch13-dielectric-mixing';
const defaults = { responseSlope: -3, alpha: 0.2, initialError: 1, steps: 16 };
const initial = iterateLinearMixingMode(defaults);
const width = 680;
const height = 300;
const pad = { left: 52, right: 20, top: 24, bottom: 46 };

const pointString = (values) => {
  const clipped = values.map((value) => Math.max(-2, Math.min(2, value)));
  return clipped.map((value, index) => {
    const x = pad.left + index * (width - pad.left - pad.right) / (values.length - 1);
    const y = pad.top + (2 - value) * (height - pad.top - pad.bottom) / 4;
    return `${x.toFixed(2)},${y.toFixed(2)}`;
  }).join(' ');
};
---

<figure class="chapter-visual mixing-explorer" id={componentId}>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：一个自洽响应模的线性混合</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: linear mixing of one self-consistent response mode</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls mixing-explorer__controls">
    <label>
      <span>固定点映射斜率 s | Fixed-point slope s</span>
      <input data-mix-slope type="range" min="-5" max="1.5" step="0.1" value={defaults.responseSlope} />
      <output data-mix-slope-output>{defaults.responseSlope.toFixed(1)}</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>混合系数 α | Mixing fraction α</span>
      <input data-mix-alpha type="range" min="0.05" max="1" step="0.05" value={defaults.alpha} />
      <output data-mix-alpha-output>{defaults.alpha.toFixed(2)}</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${width} ${height}`} role="img" aria-labelledby={`${componentId}-title ${componentId}-desc`}>
    <title id={`${componentId}-title`}>Linear-mixing error trace for one response eigenmode</title>
    <desc id={`${componentId}-desc`}>The horizontal axis is iteration number and the vertical axis is a normalized error clipped to the interval minus two to two.</desc>
    <line class="plot-axis" x1={pad.left} y1={height - pad.bottom} x2={width - pad.right} y2={height - pad.bottom} />
    <line class="plot-axis" x1={pad.left} y1={pad.top} x2={pad.left} y2={height - pad.bottom} />
    <line class="plot-guide" x1={pad.left} y1={(height + pad.top - pad.bottom) / 2} x2={width - pad.right} y2={(height + pad.top - pad.bottom) / 2} />
    <polyline class="mixing-explorer__trace" data-mix-trace points={pointString(initial.values)} />
    <text x={(width + pad.left - pad.right) / 2} y={height - 10} text-anchor="middle">iteration i</text>
    <text transform={`translate(17 ${(height + pad.top - pad.bottom) / 2}) rotate(-90)`} text-anchor="middle">normalized error</text>
    <text x={pad.left - 8} y={pad.top + 5} text-anchor="end">2</text>
    <text x={pad.left - 8} y={(height + pad.top - pad.bottom) / 2 + 5} text-anchor="end">0</text>
    <text x={pad.left - 8} y={height - pad.bottom + 5} text-anchor="end">−2</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>模因子 | mode factor:</span>
    <strong data-mix-factor>q = {initial.factor.toFixed(3)}</strong>
    <span data-mix-state>{initial.stable ? '收敛 | convergent' : '发散 | divergent'}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>把完整 SCF Jacobian 的一个本征模简化为 <code>F(e)=s e</code>，线性混合给出 <code>e_(i+1)=q e_i</code> 和 <code>q=1+α(s−1)</code>。误差无量纲，图中为避免失控只在 ±2 处裁剪。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> one eigenmode of the full SCF Jacobian is reduced to <code>F(e)=s e</code>. Linear mixing gives <code>e_(i+1)=q e_i</code> with <code>q=1+α(s−1)</code>. The error is dimensionless and is clipped at ±2 only for plotting.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong><code>s=0, α=1</code> 时 <code>q=0</code>，一步到达固定点；任意设置必须以 <code>|q|&lt;1</code> 判为收敛，<code>q&lt;0</code> 时轨迹交替变号。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> <code>s=0, α=1</code> gives <code>q=0</code> and one-step convergence. Every setting is convergent exactly when <code>|q|&lt;1</code>; a negative <code>q</code> alternates the error sign.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>这里的 <code>s</code> 是抽象固定点斜率，不直接等同于 Martin 式 (13.6) 的介电矩阵本征值；符号和变量选择依赖具体 residual 定义。模型不代表任何真实材料或代码 mixing 实现。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> <code>s</code> is an abstract fixed-point slope and is not identified directly with an eigenvalue of Martin Eq. (13.6); signs depend on the chosen residual variable. The model represents no material or production mixing implementation.</p>
  </div>

  <noscript>
    <p><strong>无 JavaScript fallback：</strong>静态轨迹使用 s=−3、α=0.20，因此 q=0.20 并单调收敛。模型定义、验收条件和边界仍完整可读。</p>
  </noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  import { iterateLinearMixingMode } from '../../../data/part04/ch13TeachingModels.mjs';

  const root = document.getElementById('ch13-dielectric-mixing');
  if (root) {
    const slope = root.querySelector('[data-mix-slope]');
    const alpha = root.querySelector('[data-mix-alpha]');
    const slopeOutput = root.querySelector('[data-mix-slope-output]');
    const alphaOutput = root.querySelector('[data-mix-alpha-output]');
    const factorOutput = root.querySelector('[data-mix-factor]');
    const stateOutput = root.querySelector('[data-mix-state]');
    const trace = root.querySelector('[data-mix-trace]');

    if (
      slope instanceof HTMLInputElement
      && alpha instanceof HTMLInputElement
      && slopeOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && alphaOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && factorOutput instanceof HTMLElement
      && stateOutput instanceof HTMLElement
      && trace instanceof SVGPolylineElement
    ) {
      const width = 680;
      const height = 300;
      const pad = { left: 52, right: 20, top: 24, bottom: 46 };
      const toPoints = (values) => values.map((rawValue, index) => {
        const value = Math.max(-2, Math.min(2, rawValue));
        const x = pad.left + index * (width - pad.left - pad.right) / (values.length - 1);
        const y = pad.top + (2 - value) * (height - pad.top - pad.bottom) / 4;
        return `${x.toFixed(2)},${y.toFixed(2)}`;
      }).join(' ');

      const update = () => {
        const responseSlope = Number(slope.value);
        const mixing = Number(alpha.value);
        const result = iterateLinearMixingMode({ responseSlope, alpha: mixing, initialError: 1, steps: 16 });
        trace.setAttribute('points', toPoints(result.values));
        slopeOutput.value = responseSlope.toFixed(1);
        alphaOutput.value = mixing.toFixed(2);
        factorOutput.textContent = `q = ${result.factor.toFixed(3)}`;
        if (result.oneStep) stateOutput.textContent = '一步到达 | one step';
        else if (result.oscillatory) stateOutput.textContent = '振荡收敛 | oscillatory convergence';
        else stateOutput.textContent = result.stable ? '收敛 | convergent' : '发散 | divergent';
      };

      slope.addEventListener('input', update);
      alpha.addEventListener('input', update);
      update();
    }
  }
</script>

<style>
  .mixing-explorer__controls {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .mixing-explorer__controls label {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .mixing-explorer input,
  .mixing-explorer svg {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .mixing-explorer svg text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .mixing-explorer__trace {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    stroke-width: 2.4;
  }

  .plot-axis {
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.4;
  }

  .plot-guide {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
  }
</style>
